label demo_end:
    scene bg_black
    athena "If we'd tried playing chess, I think your head might've exploded." # VA: Dry joke.
    athena "Mine nearly did." # VA: Deadpan follow-up.
    pause 1.0
    show bg_hallway with dissolve
    show sprite_athena_robes_neutral at Position(xalign=0.3) with dissolve
    show sprite_medusa_confused at Position(xalign=0.7) with dissolve
    medusa "I thought you were the campus champion in board games?" # VA: Genuine question.
    athena "I am." # VA: Matter-of-fact confidence.
    show sprite_athena_robes_tired at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "...Just not in chess." # VA: Reluctant admission.
    athena "That's Professor Poseidon's domain." # VA: Respectful frustration.
    show sprite_medusa_nervous at Position(xalign=0.7)
    pause 1.0
    medusa "Oh." # VA: Small uneasy reaction.
    show sprite_athena_robes_concerned at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "What?" # VA: Alert concern.
    show sprite_medusa_surprised at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "Nothing." # VA: Immediate deflection.
    medusa "It's just..." # VA: Hesitant.
    athena "Just what?" # VA: Gentle prompt.
    medusa "...I think it would be hard to play chess underwater, wouldn't you?" # VA: Awkward joke to dodge the real feeling.
    pause 1.0
    athena "Poseidon does come up to campus to lecture in Marine studies, remember?" # VA: Patient clarification.
    medusa "Yeah, I know but..." # VA: Uneasy trail-off.
    pause 2.0
    athena "Is there something wrong?" # VA: Concerned and direct.
    show sprite_medusa_dismissive at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "No! Nothing wrong." # VA: Quick over-defensive denial.
    athena "Are you sure?" # VA: Soft persistence.
    athena "Every time you hear Poseidon's name, you get very-" # VA: Careful observation.
    show sprite_medusa_eyebrow at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "It's just bizarre to know!" # VA: Forced brightness to mask discomfort.
    medusa "That even the golden girl on campus has her off days." # VA: Teasing deflection.
    pause 0.5
    show sprite_athena_robes_determined at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "I don't have off days, Medusa." # VA: Competitive pride.
    athena "Poseidon just has a head start-" # VA: Defensive correction.
    medusa "Your uncle." # VA: Playful interruption.
    pause 0.5
    show sprite_medusa_smirk at Position(xalign=0.7)
    show sprite_athena_robes_annoyed at Position(xalign=0.3)
    play sound audio.athena_sigh
    pause 1.0
    athena "My uncle, who has a head start-" # VA: Reasserting control, irritated.
    medusa "I bet you're very happy I didn't call him your daddy." # VA: Smug tease.
    show sprite_athena_robes_angry at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "MY UNCLE!" # VA: Full exasperated shout.
    athena "..." # VA: Recovering breath.
    pause 0.5
    show sprite_athena_robes_neutral at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Just has a head start on me." # VA: Controlled reset.
    athena "From centuries of practice." # VA: Rational, clipped.
    athena "That's all." # VA: Final emphasis.
    pause 0.5
    show sprite_medusa_eyebrow at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "I see." # VA: Light, unconvinced.
    pause 1.0
    medusa "I wonder if he sleeps with them, like he does with his fish." # VA: Mischievous rumor-baiting.
    show sprite_athena_robes_annoyed at Position(xalign=0.3)
    play sound audio.athena_ugh
    athena "Please don't say that again." # VA: Immediate disgust.
    athena "That's Artemis' domain." # VA: Dry reprimand.
    athena "The rumour mill." # VA: Flat, weary.
    show sprite_medusa_happy at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "Sorry, I just thought it was funny." # VA: Light apology, still amused.
    athena "What I'm trying to say..." # VA: Gathering herself.
    athena "Is that there's no substitute for persistence in life." # VA: Mentor tone, sincere.
    show sprite_athena_robes_determined at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "I will defeat Poseidon in chess..." # VA: Determined vow.
    athena "And so too will you graduate from Olympus University, Medusa." # VA: Firm encouragement.
    show sprite_medusa_neutral at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "...I think what you're trying to say there, Athena..." # VA: Playful translation.
    medusa "Is that practice makes perfect, right?" # VA: Friendly simplification.
    pause 0.5
    show sprite_athena_robes_sigh at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Yes, that's right." # VA: Sheepish admission.
    athena "Too obvious?" # VA: Self-aware, lightly embarrassed.
    medusa "Zeus gave me the same pep talk a billion times before." # VA: Dry, familiar frustration.
    play sound audio.athena_sigh
    athena "Well, I thought it was worth a try." # VA: Good-natured concession.
    pause 1.0
    show sprite_athena_robes_neutral at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Same time tomorrow, then?" # VA: Hopeful invitation.
    athena "You still have whole catalogues of board games to get through, after all." # VA: Light teasing structure.
    athena "Scrabble. Snakes and Ladders. Dungeons and Dragons. Monopoly. Dominoes." # VA: Listing with playful momentum.
    medusa "The pizza place?" # VA: Deadpan misunderstanding.
    show sprite_athena_robes_sigh at Position(xalign=0.3)
    play sound audio.athena_sigh
    athena "I'll pretend not to hear that." # VA: Sighing amusement.
    show sprite_medusa_sad at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "...Hmm, alright." # VA: Soft agreement.
    show sprite_athena_robes_happy at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Great! I'll see you tomorrow, Medusa!" # VA: Bright and sincere.
    show sprite_medusa_happy at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "See you tomorrow, Athena!" # VA: Warm return.
    scene bg_black with fade
    pause 1.0
    athena "It was a start." # VA: Reflective internal monologue.
    athena "Medusa might never be a board game genius like me, but at least she was trying." # VA: Internal monologue, fond realism.
    athena "She wanted to keep going on." # VA: Internal monologue, soft encouragement.
    athena "She wanted to get better." # VA: Internal monologue, hopeful.
    athena "And I was happy for that - at least for the time being." # VA: Internal monologue, cautious contentment.
    return